        <mxCell id="FAoIUK8rNZahvRhKB_qh-1" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tools schema publically available in MCP server&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;We are using OpenAI SDK, how can we tell to LLM about tools schema&#39;s , are available on MCP server&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Our OpenAI server sends the request to MCP Client&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;MCP Client Pass the request to MCP Server&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;MCP server returns the toolsList back to MCP Client&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Our server extracts the list of tools schemas in its local, now tool&#39;s scehma available in our local server&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
